{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>1989年開拍電影《賭聖》掀起周星馳演藝高峰，一舉將周星馳推上「喜劇之王」寶座。當年負責執導的劉鎮偉極力推薦另 …</p><p></p>\n<p>1989年開拍電影《賭聖》掀起周星馳演藝高峰，一舉將周星馳推上「喜劇之王」寶座。當年負責執導的劉鎮偉極力推薦另一位「新晉導演」執導，雙方卻在最後關頭因為幾萬元片酬陷入僵局。這份對小數目金錢上寸步不讓，最終令當事人徹底錯失締造4,100萬港元票房奇蹟大好機會。</p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179525294494143004_19856757336b0162d16dcba.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"media-1\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179525294494143004_19856757336b0162d16dcba.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>劉鎮偉賞識TVB導演李力持，本來一開始希望《他來自江湖》鐵三角合作，卻因極少數目告吹。（圖片來源：資料圖片）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<h2>劉鎮偉力薦李力持執導《賭聖》卻遇上阻滯</h2>\n<p>當年王晶執導《賭神》大受歡迎並掀起全港賭片熱潮，思遠影業老闆吳思遠隨即萌生開拍同類喜劇念頭。劉鎮偉與元奎參與商討時忽發奇想，提議將內地興起特異功能元素融入其中，並極力推薦剛剛在電視圈嶄露頭角周星馳擔任男主角。由於劉鎮偉與元奎當時正忙於趕拍另一部電影而分身乏術，劉鎮偉便向吳思遠大力推薦曾執導《他來自江湖》並略見潛力李力持出任導演，深信他與周星馳能夠擦出強烈火花，未料劇組與李力持洽談合作條件時竟在幾萬元片酬上互不相讓。<br/>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179525294641182624_20528382936b0162d2cbd72.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"media-3\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179525294641182624_20528382936b0162d2cbd72.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>劉鎮偉接受文雋的YouTube頻道訪問，透露了不少獨家資訊。（圖片來源：《文雋講呢啲講嗰啲》）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<h2>吳思遠親自拍板決定棄用李力持</h2>\n<p>面對片酬談判陷入膠著狀態，劉鎮偉坦言當時那個金錢差距極小，他回憶指出：「佢就係堅持多嗰少到呢……我真係覺得我轉頭俾咗你都仲得，你做乜仲要討價還價，仲要同會長。」吳思遠對此舉感到十分不滿，認為對方為少許金錢如此堅持，就算成功捧紅將來亦不懂感恩。吳思遠拋下一句「捧咗都冇用」後當機立斷決定換人，直接要求劉鎮偉與元奎親自上陣執導這部重頭戲。</p>\n<h2>李力持錯失良機後執導《情聖》票房遇冷</h2>\n<p>《賭聖》上映後票房狂收4,100萬港元並打破當時香港開埠紀錄，劉鎮偉因此分得一筆遠超導演片酬豐厚利潤。相比之下，李力持錯過這次黃金機會後，在隨後一年執導由周星馳主演電影《情聖》，最終票房僅收約1,655萬港元，成績與《賭聖》相距甚遠。不過這次風波並未有阻礙李力持與周星馳後續發展，兩人後來依然合作無間，共同打造出《唐伯虎點秋香》及《食神》等多部經典代表作。</p>\n<h2>網民熱烈討論周星馳經典神作換角內幕</h2>\n<p>劉鎮偉首度公開這段換角秘辛後，隨即在各大網上討論區引發熱烈迴響。大批網民對這段電影圈往事感到驚訝，有影迷留言表示：「為咗幾萬蚊錯失四千萬神作真係因小失大」、「如果當年係李力持拍，可能出唔到而家呢個經典效果」。部分觀眾從職場角度分析事件，直指吳思遠換人決定相當果斷，有網民評論：「老闆最忌員工未見功績就先掛住討價還價」、「機會從來都係留畀識得感恩同埋顧全大局員工」。</p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179525294806787098_8343278546b0162d47f6f8.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"（圖片來源：）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179525294806787098_8343278546b0162d47f6f8.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179525294978360805_16326294676b0162d632792.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"（圖片來源：）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179525294978360805_16326294676b0162d632792.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179525295150025293_18198609416b0162d7e5414.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"（圖片來源：）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179525295150025293_18198609416b0162d7e5414.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179525294494143004_19856757336b0162d16dcba.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"（圖片來源：）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179525294494143004_19856757336b0162d16dcba.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179525294641182624_20528382936b0162d2cbd72.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"（圖片來源：）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179525294641182624_20528382936b0162d2cbd72.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17952529529179630_15213681136b0162d965118.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"（圖片來源：）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17952529529179630_15213681136b0162d965118.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179525295444996146_14613468316b0162dac1927.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"（圖片來源：）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179525295444996146_14613468316b0162dac1927.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179525295607731055_16324565596b0162dc74d16.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"（圖片來源：）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179525295607731055_16324565596b0162dc74d16.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>還有什麼演唱會消息？<i></i></p>\n<p>無論是本地歌手還是外地歌手都即將在香港舉行演唱會，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%99%82%E9%96%93%E8%A1%A8-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8%E8%B3%87%E8%A8%8A-plt-777443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">演唱會時間表及購票資訊</a></b>，包括<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/mirror%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E8%A3%9C%E5%A0%B4-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-816344/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">MIRROR演唱會門票兌換安排</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%AE%B9%E7%A5%96%E5%85%92%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-plt-801047/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">容祖兒</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E7%A7%80%E6%96%87-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E7%B4%85%E9%A4%A8-plt-807968/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭秀文</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%BC%B5%E5%AD%B8%E5%8F%8B-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-786591/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">張學友</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E4%B8%AD%E5%9F%BA%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-835218/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭中基</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BA%AB%E6%8B%BF%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%94%AE%E7%A5%A8-plt-829876/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">溫拿</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E7%BE%85%E5%BF%97%E7%A5%A5%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%BA%A7%E4%BD%8D%E8%A1%A8-plt-835184/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">羅志祥</a></b>等。</p>\n<p>除了演唱會，還有什麼消閒娛樂活動？<i></i></p>\n<p>喜愛宅在家的話，觀看<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/netflix%E6%8E%A8%E8%96%A6-%E7%BE%8E%E5%8A%87-%E6%97%A5%E9%9F%93%E5%8F%B0%E5%8A%87-plt-576203/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Netflix劇集</a></b>和<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/bl%E5%8A%87-netflix-plt-583838/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">BL劇</a></b>最好不過。如果喜歡外出走走的你，也可到這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E5%AE%A4%E5%85%A7%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-629923/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>室內遊樂場、溜冰場、自助烘焙店等盡玩室內活動。想要親親大自然，也可到離島走一走，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E5%81%87%E6%9C%9F%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E9%9B%A2%E5%B3%B6%E4%B8%80%E6%97%A5%E9%81%8A-%E6%A2%85%E7%AA%A9-%E6%9D%B1%E9%BE%8D%E5%B3%B6-gt01-420918/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">離島行程攻略</a></b>或是行山，這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E9%83%8A%E9%81%8A/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E8%A1%8C%E5%B1%B1%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E7%B0%A1%E5%96%AE%E5%88%9D%E7%B4%9A%E6%96%B0%E6%89%8B%E8%B7%AF%E7%B7%9A-org115-515293/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>路線簡易，新手也適合。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e5%8a%89%e9%8e%ae%e5%81%89/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">劉鎮偉</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e5%91%a8%e6%98%9f%e9%a6%b3/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">周星馳</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e6%9d%8e%e5%8a%9b%e6%8c%81/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">李力持</a> </p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\n<p>\n資料或影片來源：<a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/3547565\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">原文刊於新假期</a>\n</p>\n</p><p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%94%9f%e6%b4%bb/%e5%a8%9b%e6%a8%82/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">娛樂</a>\nNov 21 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-21T11:03:54.135845+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1477,"images":10,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-21T09:22:38+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-21T10:57:26.892160+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-21T10:57:26.892160+00:00","content_hash":"49b72914bfc9b85e048cca8c50d83495b98fb453b790ead1b63f25315df40421","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}